825
00:45:53,200 --> 00:45:53,720
What?

826
00:45:54,880 --> 00:45:56,080
P'Laem and Preaw?

827
00:45:56,080 --> 00:45:58,080
What? P'Three had a fight with Soh?

828
00:45:58,120 --> 00:46:00,600
Yeah, he lost a match to Soh last night,

829
00:46:00,640 --> 00:46:02,240
