- I see.

831
00:46:03,680 --> 00:46:06,560
No wonder P'Three's been acting
so grumpy lately.

832
00:46:06,640 --> 00:46:08,480
He doesn't want anyone near Soh.

833
00:46:08,880 --> 00:46:10,760
They're currently in a situationship.

834
00:46:10,960 --> 00:46:12,040
They're not just talking,

835
