839
00:46:19,440 --> 00:46:22,240
She says he's just
flirting with her for fun.

840
00:46:22,520 --> 00:46:25,520
That's why she made a deal
for you to be her boyfriend.

841
00:46:25,680 --> 00:46:26,840
It's to spite Laem.

842
00:46:27,280 --> 00:46:28,800
Exactly.

843
00:46:29,120 --> 00:46:31,320
While we're at it,
why don't we go talk outside?

844
00:46:31,360 --> 00:46:32,920
But I already bought tickets
for me and Soh.

845
00:46:32,960 --> 00:46:35,880
Since when was a movie more important
than what I'm about to tell you?

846
00:46:36,840 --> 00:46:38,480
Fine, I'll treat you to som tam.

847
00:46:38,520 --> 00:46:39,760
Ten chilies, alright?

848
00:46:41,040 --> 00:46:42,240
Fine, whatever.

849
00:46:42,800 --> 00:46:45,320
But if the story you tell
isn't as spicy as that som tam,

850
00:46:45,560 --> 00:46:46,320
