851
00:46:46,520 --> 00:46:47,440
It's definitely spicy.

852
00:46:47,680 --> 00:46:48,240
Let's go.

853
00:46:50,120 --> 00:46:52,080
- Follow me.
- Hey, wait up!

854
00:46:52,080 --> 00:46:52,760
Hurry.

855
00:46:54,520 --> 00:46:55,840
I feel so guilty now

856
00:46:55,840 --> 00:46:57,200
