857
00:46:58,600 --> 00:47:01,120
But I don't feel that way
about Preaw at all.

858
00:47:02,880 --> 00:47:06,080
Anyway, I'd never be the reason
he gets his heart broken.

859
00:47:06,120 --> 00:47:06,880
Yes!

860
00:47:08,440 --> 00:47:09,840
Perfect.

861
00:47:09,880 --> 00:47:13,160
- Now that is what I call brotherhood.
- Right.

862
00:47:13,200 --> 00:47:14,440
We members of B.S. Brothers

863
00:47:14,480 --> 00:47:16,720
