Were you really that scared?

883
00:48:33,640 --> 00:48:35,080
What? Who said I was scared?

884
00:48:35,920 --> 00:48:37,640
That's just how pros eat.

885
00:48:37,720 --> 00:48:38,240
Here.

886
00:48:42,440 --> 00:48:43,000
Alright, then.

887
00:48:43,640 --> 00:48:44,560
