907
00:51:15,120 --> 00:51:16,280
Well, P'Three...

908
00:51:16,440 --> 00:51:17,040
Yes?

909
00:51:17,240 --> 00:51:18,440
I'm heading home now.

910
00:51:18,760 --> 00:51:19,440
Okay.

911
00:51:20,560 --> 00:51:22,120
Let home know when you get me. Oh, no...

912
00:51:25,360 --> 00:51:26,640
Let me know when you get home.

913
00:51:55,320 --> 00:51:56,080
- What?
- What?

914
00:51:56,120 --> 00:51:57,440
- P'Three held your hand?
- P'Three held your hand?

915
00:51:58,680 --> 00:52:00,720
Damn, he definitely likes you.

916
00:52:00,800 --> 00:52:02,400
Maybe it was just cold?

917
