I couldn't think of anything else.

927
00:52:22,960 --> 00:52:24,000
It just happened.

928
00:52:25,320 --> 00:52:26,440
Yeah, that's weird.

929
00:52:28,040 --> 00:52:31,680
I think I heard
he used to date a girl, though.

930
00:52:31,760 --> 00:52:34,320
