her name was Belle or something.

931
00:52:34,400 --> 00:52:37,000
Hey, bisexuals exist, you know.

932
00:52:37,000 --> 00:52:38,680
Don't just assume
people's orientation like that.

933
00:52:40,160 --> 00:52:41,160
What do you think, Soh?

934
00:52:41,280 --> 00:52:42,520
What if P'Three
actually has feelings for you?

935
00:52:43,080 --> 00:52:44,240
He...

936
00:52:44,400 --> 00:52:45,240
