937
00:52:45,720 --> 00:52:46,720
just...

938
00:52:47,320 --> 00:52:48,200
messed with me.

939
00:52:48,680 --> 00:52:51,480
And he just walked out
of the theater like that?

940
00:52:51,520 --> 00:52:53,160
What the hell does that even mean?

941
00:52:54,440 --> 00:52:56,040
That means...

942
00:52:56,840 --> 00:52:58,760
