943
00:53:00,840 --> 00:53:02,640
He usually messes with me
pretty hard anyway.

944
00:53:02,680 --> 00:53:03,600
That's not it.

945
00:53:03,640 --> 00:53:05,160
It's not about
whether he was messing with you or not.

946
00:53:05,160 --> 00:53:07,160
It's about how you actually feel.

947
00:53:07,280 --> 00:53:08,280
Or maybe...

948
00:53:08,680 --> 00:53:10,200
he just doesn't like...

949
