The movie?

950
00:53:11,360 --> 00:53:12,280
You!

951
00:53:15,240 --> 00:53:16,280
He doesn't like me?

952
00:53:16,320 --> 00:53:17,520
Yeah, he doesn't.

953
00:53:20,960 --> 00:53:21,880
Laem...

954
00:53:22,200 --> 00:53:23,680
