- It's okay, man.

955
00:53:23,720 --> 00:53:25,520
Doctor, help me!

956
00:53:27,160 --> 00:53:28,840
(It's not about
whether he was messing with you or not.)

957
00:53:28,880 --> 00:53:30,760
(It's about how you actually feel.)

958
00:53:31,720 --> 00:53:32,480
Whatever.

959
00:53:33,960 --> 00:53:35,120
(Today's mission is)

960
00:53:35,280 --> 00:53:37,040
(to choose what your heart desires.)

961
00:53:38,600 --> 00:53:39,480
(A:)

962
00:53:39,880 --> 00:53:43,680
(Recall. Open the door
and we'll fight this out together.)

963
00:53:45,240 --> 00:53:47,040
Wait, why does this sound so familiar?

964
00:53:47,080 --> 00:53:47,800
(B:)

965
00:53:48,040 --> 00:53:52,360
(Surrender. Just tell me.
I'll understand and walk away.)

966
00:53:52,800 --> 00:53:54,520
(Either way,)

967
00:53:54,560 --> 00:53:56,640
(I'm always by your side.)

968
00:53:57,240 --> 00:53:57,960
Wait...

969
00:53:58,600 --> 00:54:00,200
Have I played this level before?

970
00:54:03,160 --> 00:54:04,520
(Want it to feel even more familiar?)

971
00:54:05,120 --> 00:54:06,520
(I'll make it happen.)

972
00:54:15,160 --> 00:54:17,360
(According to scientists,)

973
00:54:18,320 --> 00:54:21,120
(a hug makes you happier.)

974
00:54:21,240 --> 00:54:23,960
(If you don't rush over here
to recharge your happiness battery,)

975
00:54:24,800 --> 00:54:26,400
(you're gonna miss your chance.)

976
00:54:30,480 --> 00:54:33,080
(If you can't handle it,
or if you're not ready to go back,)

977
00:54:33,120 --> 00:54:34,120
(it's totally fine.)

978
00:54:34,840 --> 00:54:35,640
(Right now,)

979
00:54:36,240 --> 00:54:38,240
(your feelings are what matter most.)

980
00:54:39,960 --> 00:54:40,960
(You got that, kiddo?)

981
00:54:42,040 --> 00:54:43,040
(Today's mission is
to choose what your heart desires.)

982
00:54:43,040 --> 00:54:44,240
(A: Recall. Open the door
and we'll fight this out together.)

983
00:54:44,240 --> 00:54:45,320
(B: Surrender. Just tell me.
I'll understand and walk away.)

984
00:54:45,320 --> 00:54:46,480
(P.S. Either way,
I'm always by your side.)

985
00:54:49,400 --> 00:54:52,360
(This is P'Belle's Insta,
P'Three's ex I told you about.)

986
00:55:15,080 --> 00:55:23,400
(Good luck, Three)

987
00:56:20,680 --> 00:56:22,800
Why are you two acting so weird?

988
00:56:23,360 --> 00:56:24,360
Did something happen between you two?

989
00:56:25,000 --> 00:56:27,000
Yeah, he looks pretty down.

990
00:56:28,920 --> 00:56:29,880
