991
00:56:32,160 --> 00:56:33,120
P'Toobtub!

992
00:56:34,040 --> 00:56:35,320
Thank you.

993
00:56:36,400 --> 00:56:37,320
Bro!

994
00:56:45,120 --> 00:56:46,000
Here.

995
00:56:46,360 --> 00:56:48,600
Alright, good evening.

996
00:56:48,640 --> 00:56:51,080
Welcome, ladies and gentlemen.

997
00:56:51,120 --> 00:56:54,200
The moment you've all
been waiting for has arrived.

998
00:56:54,240 --> 00:56:55,720
