1002
00:56:59,480 --> 00:57:00,720
No, that's not it.

1003
00:57:00,760 --> 00:57:04,320
It's the interview session
for the newlyweds.

1004
00:57:04,360 --> 00:57:07,160
Oh, I see.

1005
00:57:07,360 --> 00:57:10,240
Wow, look at P'Toobtub's face today.

1006
00:57:10,280 --> 00:57:12,000
He's grinning from ear to ear.

1007
00:57:12,040 --> 00:57:13,840
Whoa, of course he is!

1008
00:57:13,880 --> 00:57:15,920
Our groom really had to work his way

1009
00:57:15,960 --> 00:57:18,000
