- Right.

1017
00:57:35,440 --> 00:57:37,640
especially a single woman like me.

1018
00:57:37,920 --> 00:57:38,760
Well...

1019
00:57:38,880 --> 00:57:39,880
P'Jane,

1020
00:57:40,280 --> 00:57:45,160
why did you choose a tough-looking tank
who's really just a big softie?

1021
00:57:45,320 --> 00:57:47,400
How did you know he was the one?

1022
00:57:47,760 --> 00:57:49,640
Honestly, I don't really know, either.

1023
00:57:49,680 --> 00:57:50,760
- Wait, what?
- Huh?

1024
00:57:51,000 --> 00:57:53,800
You see, P'Toobtub...

1025
00:57:54,200 --> 00:57:55,520
expresses himself through actions.

1026
00:57:55,680 --> 00:57:56,760
- I see.
- I see.

1027
00:57:56,800 --> 00:57:59,280
He's not the type
to say things out loud or be direct.

1028
00:58:00,240 --> 00:58:01,640
Like when...

1029
00:58:02,920 --> 00:58:04,160
he first approached me,

1030
00:58:04,240 --> 00:58:05,640
he just asked me to play games with him.

1031
00:58:09,320 --> 00:58:12,120
When I was sick, he took care of me.

1032
00:58:15,120 --> 00:58:16,640
When he took me to the movies,

1033
00:58:17,240 --> 00:58:19,440
