and held my hand.

1034
00:58:28,040 --> 00:58:30,120
Without saying a single word.

1035
00:58:30,400 --> 00:58:31,640
Why does this sound so familiar?

1036
00:58:33,360 --> 00:58:35,960
He did all that,
and you still didn't realize?

1037
00:58:37,040 --> 00:58:38,360
No, I had no idea.

1038
00:58:39,720 --> 00:58:41,680
I mean, I wouldn't let myself
assume anything

1039
00:58:45,120 --> 00:58:47,840
until he actually said he loves me.

1040
00:58:56,680 --> 00:58:57,680
Well...

1041
00:58:57,760 --> 00:58:59,520
Sorry, but to be honest...

1042
00:58:59,760 --> 00:59:00,560
Well,

1043
00:59:01,000 --> 00:59:03,760
I thought Jane...

1044
00:59:04,440 --> 00:59:07,960
already knew exactly
why I was doing all of that.

1045
00:59:09,000 --> 00:59:09,800
Wait, what?

1046
00:59:09,920 --> 00:59:11,400
Alright, okay.

1047
00:59:11,480 --> 00:59:14,000
