1054
00:59:32,080 --> 00:59:33,080
I'm not.

1055
00:59:34,600 --> 00:59:36,880
You know, right?

1056
00:59:37,800 --> 00:59:39,040
Know what?

1057
00:59:39,240 --> 00:59:40,840
I don't know a thing.

1058
00:59:41,760 --> 00:59:43,120
You know how I feel about you.

1059
00:59:45,600 --> 00:59:46,400
Oh...

1060
00:59:47,000 --> 00:59:47,800
I know.

1061
00:59:48,280 --> 00:59:50,040
You think I'm just a derpy kid.

1062
00:59:53,440 --> 00:59:54,480
Derpy...

1063
00:59:54,920 --> 00:59:55,920
and stubborn.

1064
00:59:57,480 --> 00:59:58,600
And on top of that,

1065
00:59:59,120 --> 01:00:00,400
