1068
01:00:08,160 --> 01:00:10,800
What joke? I'm not joking at all.

1069
01:00:18,640 --> 01:00:20,680
I actually like you.

1070
01:00:25,400 --> 01:00:28,000
See? You're still messing with me.

1071
01:00:29,640 --> 01:00:31,520
What do you want me to do

1072
01:00:31,560 --> 01:00:33,560
